speechtext:
The hon.
member for Rosthern is asking me to contradict something which he himself is not definite about. He says, "something to that effect." Now will he make a definite statement? I am quite prepared to contradict it;
I will say most definitely that the C.C.F. in no province in Canada have at any time advocated the collectivization of land as in Russia or anywhere else. I state that most categorically.
